 spec=(R/'01_frozen_protocol/EXECUTION_SPECIFICATION.txt').read_text(encoding='utf8');section=spec.split('# 18. REQUIRED FINAL QUESTIONS')[1].split('# 19.')[0];questions=re.findall(r'^\d+\. (.+)$',section,re.M);assert len(questions)==len(answers)==35
 doc('R8E10R1_MASTER_REPORT.md','C02 Tet10 recovery and mesh-pair qualification','**R8E10R1_MESH_RECOVERY_COMPLETE — pre-solver mesh pair qualified; no native or AI execution.**\n\nThe invalid M1 was repaired by moving only one of four eligible interior midsides, maximum displacement0.0196508211 mm. External geometry and connectivity remained exact. One complete M1 candidate and one M2 candidate passed all frozen quality, full-source fidelity, topology, hierarchy and BVP mesh-geometry gates.\n\n| Quantity | Recovered M1 | M2 |\n|---|---:|---:|\n| Nodes |145527|193962|\n| Tet10 elements |82498|109737|\n| Minimum SICN |0.0350000000|0.0634291190|\n| Minimum Q1 detJ (mm³) |0.00444250195|0.00450120192|\n| Negative/zero Q1 elements |0/0|0/0|\n| Forward P95/max (mm) |0.001928801/0.008699451|0.001842450/0.007785679|\n| Reverse P95/max (mm) |0.002744363/0.023077044|0.002700924/0.024530793|\n| Near-weld median/P90 edge (mm) |0.400617341/0.412006779|0.300664474/0.305606160|\n\nThe root cause is a numerical curvature-placement incompatibility, not a source-geometry defect, incorrect ordering or invalid straight corner tetrahedron. The shared on-CAD boundary midside is retained. No measured surface smoothing, source deletion or threshold relaxation occurred.\n\n## Explicit answers to the35 requested questions\n\n'+'\n\n'.join('**'+str(i)+'. '+q+'**\n\n'+v for i,(q,v) in enumerate(zip(questions,answers),1))+'\n\n## Inspectable evidence\n\n- ORIGINAL_FAILURE_METRICS.json and INVALID_ELEMENT_CONNECTIVITY.csv\n- ROOT_CAUSE_HYPOTHESIS_MATRIX.csv and SINGLE_MIDSIDE_CAUSAL_DIAGNOSTICS.csv\n- LOCAL_REPAIR_TRIALS.csv and LOCAL_NODE_DISPLACEMENTS.csv\n- 06_recovered_M1/M1_C1 and07_refined_M2/M2_C1\n- 08_quadratic_quality exact local Bernstein certificates\n- 10_mesh_hierarchy/PAIR_PRE_SOLVER_QUALIFICATION.json\n- 11_mechanical_mesh_preflight for un-applied BVP feasibility\n- PRE_SOLVER_GATE_DECISIONS.csv and final reproducibility manifest\n\nNo V1 stress reference or training dataset is qualified by mesh checks alone. Native import, shape warnings, equilibrium, tensor accuracy and T2 numerical consistency remain unexecuted.')
 doc('13_reports/REPORT_INDEX.md','Report index','All requested named reports are at the workspace root. Start with R8E10R1_MASTER_REPORT.md and FINAL_R8E10R1_DECISION.md. Full mesh data and receipts are in06_recovered_M1 and07_refined_M2. Local exact certificates are in08_quadratic_quality. No ANSYS or AI results exist in this release.')
